              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>Personalized treatment plans</span>
          </li>

          <li class="who__feature-item">
            <span class="who__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 12 16" fill="none">
                <path d="M 2.956 11.999 C 2.733 11.044 1.728 10.264 1.316 9.749 C 0.609 8.867 0.167 7.803 0.039 6.679 C -0.089 5.556 0.102 4.42 0.592 3.401 C 1.082 2.382 1.849 1.522 2.806 0.921 C 3.763 0.319 4.871 0 6.001 0 C 7.131 0 8.239 0.32 9.195 0.922 C 10.152 1.524 10.919 2.384 11.409 3.403 C 11.898 4.422 12.09 5.558 11.961 6.681 C 11.833 7.804 11.39 8.868 10.683 9.751 C 10.271 10.264 9.267 11.045 9.044 11.999 L 2.955 11.999 Z M 9 13.499 L 9 14.249 C 9 14.647 8.842 15.029 8.561 15.31 C 8.28 15.591 7.898 15.749 7.5 15.749 L 4.5 15.749 C 4.102 15.749 3.721 15.591 3.439 15.31 C 3.158 15.029 3 14.647 3 14.249 L 3 13.499 Z M 6.75 6.003 L 6.75 2.999 L 3.375 7.503 L 5.25 7.503 L 5.25 10.503 L 8.625 6.003 L 6.75 6.003 Z" fill="#0F766E"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>Comfortable and pain-free process</span>
          </li>

          <li class="who__feature-item">
            <span class="who__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none">
